  "ingredients": [
    "2 Italian sausage links, casings removed",
    "1 pound lean ground beef",
    "1 yellow onion, chopped",
    "2 cloves garlic, chopped",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1 (15 ounce) can tomato sauce",
    "1 (14.5 ounce) can whole peeled tomatoes",
    "0.25 cup chopped fresh oregano",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon dried basil",
    "1 bay leaf",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 (16 ounce) package uncooked spaghetti",
    "0.5 cup grated Parmesan cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X5-JrdeWhI-sEcRf-0Mz4qmx3Js=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148543-camp-david-spaghetti-with-italian-sausage-VAT-013-step-01-b0dd084120644223bcf814897b58f54c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148543/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice sausages lengthwise, leaving links attached along one side; lay flat in a large skillet. Cook over medium heat until browned and cooked through, 5 minutes, flipping once. Transfer to a plate; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4qHZWlyRe3SXO4a5uT6uBUudosA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148543-camp-david-spaghetti-with-italian-sausage-VAT-014-step-02-c6a6e3f44ad84a559ca35ff1b9fff5d7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148543/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add ground beef, onion, garlic, and olive oil to the same skillet over medium heat; cook and stir until onion is translucent and beef is browned and crumbly, about 10 minutes. Drain all but 2 tablespoons drippings from the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JVOye4kWU5vh4PjSfUiWy1jcGxc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148543-camp-david-spaghetti-with-italian-sausage-VAT-015-step-03-2e443a4771f84b1f814385198d8ae8a6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148543/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in tomato sauce, tomatoes, oregano, salt, basil, bay leaf, and black pepper; simmer, uncovered, over low heat until flavors have blended, about 1 hour, stirring occasionally. Remove and discard bay leaf.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/S0cN0zI2npU0FReEquZDnkqLSWg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148543-camp-david-spaghetti-with-italian-sausage-VAT-016-step-04-a7c88eef089342f6a47cf9e8093cd5f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148543/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook spaghetti in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, 8 to 10 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c8KmHXfOQvY85L60dFT7rhs1Rig=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148543-camp-david-spaghetti-with-italian-sausage-VAT-017-step-05-1d833109f1994721b7d8ec97f00453d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148543/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir spaghetti into sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OzhC4KK-UjJHH_XoZAljpAgvoPA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148543-camp-david-spaghetti-with-italian-sausage-VAT-018-step-06-1f03617db4154684ab51f345dd3da784.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148543/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide spaghetti and sauce among individual oven-safe baking dishes or plates; top each with a cooked half sausage and sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mksTBsvh7a_PQtfkfNpgl_i8vTA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148543-camp-david-spaghetti-with-italian-sausage-VAT-019-step-07-e378f513cbb24fcbaafd111dbb88578d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148543/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cheese is melted and begins to brown, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tdT_TX8FS1U7nBzt6Q1l4ieZZ1c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148543-camp-david-spaghetti-with-italian-sausage-VAT-020-step-08-d59e308be20e42e88275fe30e19c25ec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148543/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
